# Rust build output
target/

# Tauri build-time generated files.
#
# gen/schemas/ (desktop capability/permission schemas) is regenerated on every
# build and stays ignored.
#
# gen/apple/ (the iOS scaffold from `just ios-init`) IS tracked: project.yml is
# the XcodeGen source of truth and the generated Xcode project is committed per
# Tauri maintainer guidance, so CI and Phases 54-57 build from a reproducible
# scaffold and can edit it (tauri.ios.conf.json, capabilities/ios.json,
# PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy). The transient subdirs (xcuserdata/, build/, Externals/)
# are handled by the nested gen/apple/.gitignore that `tauri ios init` writes.
gen/schemas/

# Pods/ is fetched by `pod install` at build time (not covered by the nested
# gen/apple/.gitignore) — never commit it.
gen/apple/Pods/
